implementation = "Repair only the scoped guest build, stale kernel test link inputs, orphan archive target, merged release builder and their documentation; preserve the README architecture already corrected by 22.31.470 and the RELEASE verification/recovery procedures. No spec files, registry entries, native consumers, workflows or unrelated recipes are edited."
